  "memo": "R08 holds because four accounts used the shipping address. Although it is the account's home, its recent registration prevents the household exception. Linkage is the sole adverse family; no other rule holds and no earlier outcome settles the order. The required id_check passed, so §5.3(a) requires clear and prohibits further holding or adverse action. Household sharing is the strongest benign explanation. Verification establishes identity and card control, not repayment intent, but no installment was due and no independent intent finding supports action. No further check is needed."
